{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":27710,"name":"Enzo","username":"cool007zqw","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/talk.nervos.org/cool007zqw/{size}/1679_2.png","created_at":"2026-11-23T08:15:26.087Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e( English below )\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-27710-ckb-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-27710-ckb-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e这是什么？为什么要做在 CKB 上？\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCellCat 是一个跑在 CKB 上的全链上基因猫小游戏，玩法很简单：\u003cstrong\u003e领养 → 配对产蛋 → 等出块孵化 → 挂单交易 / 熔猫\u003c/strong\u003e。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e选 CKB 带来的特性：\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e猫有真地板价\u003c/strong\u003e：每只猫都是一个真实的 Cell，喂食就是往里存 CKB；不想玩了随时“熔猫”，Cell 里的 CKB 全退回钱包。\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e不存图，链上算基因\u003c/strong\u003e：每只猫只存 32 字节 DNA（显性+隐性基因），繁殖先产蛋、到指定块高取区块头做随机源，链上重算 DNA 防作弊。\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e无托管原子交易\u003c/strong\u003e：用 \u003ccode\u003esale-lock\u003c/code\u003e 挂单，买家付够 CKB 直接换锁成交，卖家随时撤单，不需要把猫转给平台托管。\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e零门槛\u003c/strong\u003e：接入 JoyID，不用装插件背助记词，打开网页就能玩。\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-27710-devnet-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-27710-devnet-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e目前已经做完的部分（本地 Devnet 已跑通）\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e4 个 Rust 合约\u003c/strong\u003e（\u003ccode\u003ecat-type\u003c/code\u003e、\u003ccode\u003eegg-type\u003c/code\u003e、\u003ccode\u003esale-lock\u003c/code\u003e、\u003ccode\u003econfig-type\u003c/code\u003e）：纯手写字节布局和 \u003ccode\u003eckb_std::syscalls\u003c/code\u003e，避开了 \u003ccode\u003eriscv64imac\u003c/code\u003e 原子指令的坑。\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e跨端基因库\u003c/strong\u003e：Rust（\u003ccode\u003eno_std\u003c/code\u003e）和前端 JS 逐字节一致，有 82 条自动化校验向量。\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e合约测试\u003c/strong\u003e：\u003ccode\u003eckb-testtool\u003c/code\u003e 写了 20 多个正常和异常用例（防改 DNA、冷却、次数上限、繁育费、区块头、挂单少付/错付等），已全过。\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e移动端网页\u003c/strong\u003e：猫舍、繁育、集市、明信片生成和基础社交交互在本地 devnet 上已经能玩。\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/0/0cb16da599c977a7d963a7328925f0d62fa4f27f.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/0cb16da599c977a7d963a7328925f0d62fa4f27f\" title=\"图片\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/0cb16da599c977a7d963a7328925f0d62fa4f27f_2_256x500.jpeg\" alt=\"图片\" data-base62-sha1=\"1OhROKNpuuWjDXtkOWJ7C6vIfqD\" width=\"256\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/0cb16da599c977a7d963a7328925f0d62fa4f27f_2_256x500.jpeg, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/0cb16da599c977a7d963a7328925f0d62fa4f27f_2_384x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/0cb16da599c977a7d963a7328925f0d62fa4f27f_2_512x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"545A65\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003e图片\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1440×2802 387 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-27710-h-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-27710-h-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e开发规划\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e第 1 周\u003c/strong\u003e：完善玩法机制；美化视觉资产；复查合约的边界；测试经济学可持续性；部署到 \u003cstrong\u003eCKB Testnet\u003c/strong\u003e 。做数据统计 dashboard。\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e第 2 周\u003c/strong\u003e：上公网 HTTPS 服务器，小范围拉 \u003cstrong\u003e20–50 个内测玩家\u003c/strong\u003e，实测领养、繁殖孵化、买卖、喂食和熔猫全流程。\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e第 3 周\u003c/strong\u003e：内测收尾，发放激励，汇总反馈。进一步完善代码。\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e第 4 周\u003c/strong\u003e：接通 \u003cstrong\u003eJoyID（Testnet）\u003c/strong\u003e。交付代码、演示录屏。\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-27710-h-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-27710-h-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e验收\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e直接玩\u003c/strong\u003e：打开公网链接，用 JoyID 领猫、配种、等孵化、去集市挂单/买猫、熔掉退回 CKB，全流程可以体验验证。\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e查浏览器\u003c/strong\u003e：结项时我会把 4 个合约的部署哈希，以及领养、繁殖、孵化、成交、熔猫的 Testnet 交易哈希全贴出来啊。 ，直接在 Explorer 上对账。\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e看录屏\u003c/strong\u003e：附一段 2 分钟无剪辑实操录屏。\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e跑源码测试\u003c/strong\u003e：拉下仓库直接在本地或者服务器部署运行\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-27710-h-680-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-27710-h-680-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e预算：$680\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"md-table\"\u003e\n\u003ctable\u003e\n\u003cthead\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003e项目\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth\u003e说明\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e金额\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/thead\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e人工工时\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e30 小时 × $15/小时\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e$450\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eAI Token\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e编码 + 排查测试 + 猫猫部件美术素材优化\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e$100\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e内测用户激励\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e发给参与完整测试和报有效 Bug 的社区玩家（规则和转账记录全公开）\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e$100\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e服务器\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e云服务器 + 域名/HTTPS（覆盖内测及结项展示）\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e$30\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e合计\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e$680\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-27710-h-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-27710-h-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e关于我\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e简介：业余全栈开发，\u003ca href=\"http://ckb123.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eckb123.com\u003c/a\u003e（已下线）站长，CKB 主网启动参与者之一\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGitHub： \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/cool007zqw\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003ecool007zqw (Enzo Zheng) · GitHub\u003c/a\u003e 大部分项目涉及工作或个人信息因此没有设为公开可见\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e联系：请直接通过 Nervos Talk 联络\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat Is This, and Why Build It on CKB?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCellCat is a fully on-chain genetic cat game built on CKB. The gameplay is simple: Adopt → Breed to produce eggs → Wait for block-based hatching → List for sale or burn cats.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy CKB?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReal floor value for every cat: Each cat is represented by a real Cell. Feeding a cat means depositing CKB into its Cell. If you no longer want to play, you can simply “burn” the cat and recover all the CKB stored in its Cell back to your wallet.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo images stored on-chain; genetics are computed on-chain: Each cat stores only 32 bytes of DNA (dominant + recessive genes). Breeding first produces an egg. Once a designated block height is reached, the block header is used as a randomness source, and the DNA is recomputed on-chain to prevent cheating.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNon-custodial atomic trading: Cats are listed using sale-lock. Buyers can complete a purchase by paying the required amount of CKB and unlocking the transaction directly. Sellers can cancel their listings at any time. Cats never need to be transferred to a platform for custody.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eZero-friction onboarding: Integrated with JoyID. No browser extensions or seed phrases required. Just open the website and start playing.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat Has Been Completed So Far\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe entire system has been successfully tested on a local Devnet.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSmart contracts\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFour Rust contracts implemented: “cat-type”, “egg-type”, “sale-lock”, and “config-type”.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHandwritten byte layouts and “ckb_std::syscalls” are used to avoid issues with unsupported atomic instructions in “riscv64imac”.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCross-platform genetics library\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe Rust (“no_std”) and frontend JavaScript implementations produce byte-for-byte identical results.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e82 automated test vectors are in place to verify consistency.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSmart contract testing\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMore than 20 test cases implemented using “ckb-testtool”, covering both normal and edge cases.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTest coverage includes DNA tampering prevention, cooldowns, breeding limits, breeding fees, block header validation, and underpayment/incorrect payment during marketplace transactions.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAll tests are passing.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMobile-friendly web application\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe cattery, breeding system, marketplace, postcard generation, and basic social interactions are all playable on the local Devnet.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDevelopment Roadmap\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeek 1:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFinalize gameplay mechanics.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePolish visual assets.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReview smart contract edge cases.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEvaluate the economic sustainability of the game.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDeploy to CKB Testnet.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBuild a data analytics dashboard.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeek 2:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLaunch a public HTTPS server.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRecruit 20–50 players for a small closed beta.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTest the complete user journey, including adoption, breeding, hatching, trading, feeding, and burning cats.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeek 3:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWrap up the closed beta.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDistribute participation incentives.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCollect and review user feedback.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFurther improve the codebase.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeek 4:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrate JoyID on Testnet.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDeliver the source code and a recorded demonstration.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAcceptance Criteria\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePlay the game directly\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOpen the public URL and use JoyID to adopt cats, breed them, wait for eggs to hatch, list or purchase cats on the marketplace, and burn cats to recover their CKB. The entire gameplay loop will be publicly accessible and verifiable.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col start=\"2\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVerify on the blockchain\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt project completion, I will publish the deployment transaction hashes of all four smart contracts, along with the Testnet transaction hashes for adoption, breeding, hatching, successful trades, and cat burning.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEverything can be independently verified and reconciled directly through the CKB Explorer.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col start=\"3\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWatch an unedited demo\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA two-minute, unedited screen recording demonstrating the actual gameplay will be provided.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col start=\"4\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRun the source code and tests\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eClone the repository and deploy and run the project locally or on your own server.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBudget\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTotal budget: $680\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eItem| Description| Amount\u003cbr\u003e\nDevelopment labor| 30 hours × $15/hour| $450\u003cbr\u003e\nAI tokens| Coding, debugging, testing, and optimization of cat visual assets| $100\u003cbr\u003e\nBeta tester incentives| Rewards for community members who complete testing and report valid bugs (all rules and transaction records will be public)| $100\u003cbr\u003e\nServer| Cloud server, domain, and HTTPS (covering the beta and final demonstration)| $30\u003cbr\u003e\nTotal| | $680\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAbout Me\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBackground: Hobbyist full-stack developer, founder of \u003ca href=\"http://ckb123.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eckb123.com\u003c/a\u003e (now offline), and one of the early participants in the CKB Mainnet launch.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGitHub: Most of my projects involve work-related or personal information, so their repositories are not publicly accessible.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eContact: Please reach out to me directly via Nervos Talk.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":5,"updated_at":"2026-11-28T05:53:06.779Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":2,"reads":30,"readers_count":29,"score":136.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":11308,"topic_slug":"spark-program-cellcat-ckb","display_username":"Enzo","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"http://ckb123.com","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":4},{"url":"https://github.com/cool007zqw","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"cool007zqw (Enzo Zheng) · GitHub","clicks":1},{"url":"https://talk.nervos.org/t/ckb-ecosystem-biweekly-update/9821/35","internal":true,"reflection":true,"title":"CKB Ecosystem Biweekly Update","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":"Star Writer","title_is_group":false,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":4}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":1064,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/spark-program-cellcat-ckb/11308/1","babel_translations_meta":[{"language":"es","status":"failed","source_language":"zh-cn"},{"language":"en","status":"completed","source_language":"zh-cn"}],"show_translation_widget":true,"show_translation_button":true,"babel_detected_locale":"zh-cn","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":4}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":4,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false,"can_translate":false},{"id":27892,"name":"Joii2020","username":"joii2020","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/talk.nervos.org/joii2020/{size}/10348_2.png","created_at":"2026-11-27T03:11:15.801Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eI’m thinking that the highest difficulty of many games requires one life to complete the game. Can this be accomplished through the characteristics of CKB Cell?\u003cbr\u003e\nPlayers spend money to mint a CKB Cell to play the game. Saving the game progress is a transaction for this Cell. If the game over, the Cell is permanently locked.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":2,"post_type":1,"posts_count":5,"updated_at":"2026-11-27T03:11:15.801Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":18,"readers_count":17,"score":63.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":11308,"topic_slug":"spark-program-cellcat-ckb","display_username":"Joii2020","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":2}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":4120,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/spark-program-cellcat-ckb/11308/2","babel_translations_meta":[{"language":"es","status":"completed","source_language":"en"},{"language":"zh-cn","status":"completed","source_language":"en"}],"show_translation_widget":true,"show_translation_button":true,"babel_detected_locale":"en","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":2}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":2,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_translate":false},{"id":27893,"name":"yixiu.ckbfans.bit","username":"yixiu.ckbfans.bit","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/talk.nervos.org/yixiu.ckbfans.bit/{size}/10551_2.png","created_at":"2026-11-27T04:31:57.719Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi, Enzo, CellCat 是一个蛮有意思的项目，我认为它完全有可能走向我们的社区用户。不过我们留意到你在CellCat里自己做了\u003ccode\u003ecat-type\u003c/code\u003e, \u003ccode\u003eegg-type\u003c/code\u003e，不知你能否考虑使用现有的spore协议来实现，原因是生态里目前对nft的适配方面，对spore的支持是最好的。若新开发一套nft type标准，会带来较多的适配工作，比如钱包、ccc、交易市场、资产管理器、浏览器等都需要做一遍兼容性适配，这会带来一些挑战。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e另外， 你的开发计划里提到 接通 \u003cstrong\u003eJoyID（Testnet）\u003c/strong\u003e。是否有考虑直接接 \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/@ckb-ccc/connector-react\"\u003e@ckb-ccc/connector-react\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e （以下简称ccc），通过几行代码，就可以\u003cstrong\u003e对接上生态里支持的所有钱包\u003c/strong\u003e，你只需要关注自己的业务即可。 我们也为ccc专门做了一套用于AI 访问和使用ccc相关模块的skills，详情在这里：\u003ca href=\"https://docs.ckbccc.com/zh/docs/ai-resources/set-up-ai-tools\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003e配置你的 AI 工具\u003c/a\u003e 。\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":3,"post_type":1,"posts_count":5,"updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:31:57.719Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":17,"readers_count":16,"score":18.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":11308,"topic_slug":"spark-program-cellcat-ckb","display_username":"yixiu.ckbfans.bit","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://docs.ckbccc.com/zh/docs/ai-resources/set-up-ai-tools","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"配置你的 AI 工具","clicks":1},{"url":"https://www.npmjs.com/package/@ckb-ccc/connector-react","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":true,"admin":false,"staff":true,"user_id":2471,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/spark-program-cellcat-ckb/11308/3","babel_translations_meta":[{"language":"en","status":"completed","source_language":"zh-cn"},{"language":"es","status":"completed","source_language":"zh-cn"}],"show_translation_widget":true,"show_translation_button":true,"babel_detected_locale":"zh-cn","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_translate":false},{"id":27899,"name":"God","username":"matt.eth","avatar_template":"/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/b487fb/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-11-27T08:30:52.561Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e考古了这条帖子 \u003ca href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/t/nervos-ckb/8881/4\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eNervos 的未来和 CKB 价格展望 - #4 by cool007zqw\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n当初你对 ckb 熊市时的价格预测是很有眼光的，请问现在你对 ckb 看法有什么变化吗？\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":4,"post_type":1,"posts_count":5,"updated_at":"2026-11-27T08:30:52.561Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":15,"readers_count":14,"score":3.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":11308,"topic_slug":"spark-program-cellcat-ckb","display_username":"God","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://talk.nervos.org/t/nervos-ckb/8881/4","internal":true,"reflection":false,"title":"Nervos 的未来和 CKB 价格展望","clicks":10}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":3009,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/spark-program-cellcat-ckb/11308/4","babel_translations_meta":[{"language":"en","status":"completed","source_language":"zh-cn"},{"language":"es","status":"completed","source_language":"zh-cn"}],"show_translation_widget":true,"show_translation_button":true,"babel_detected_locale":"zh-cn","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_translate":false},{"id":27924,"name":"行天春彦","username":"xingtianchunyan","avatar_template":"/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/x/7cd45c/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-11-28T05:59:02.731Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e你好 \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/cool007zqw\"\u003e@cool007zqw\u003c/a\u003e，\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e感谢你持续关注 Spark Program，并提交 CellCat 提案。委员会认为，暖暖猫舍的玩法有潜力吸引社区成员上手体验。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e经委员会讨论，提案目前为 \u003cstrong\u003ePending（待处理）\u003c/strong\u003e。结合一休哥在楼上的反馈，请在修订稿中说明以下两点：\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e资产与交易\u003c/strong\u003e：请评估 \u003ccode\u003ecat-type\u003c/code\u003e 和 \u003ccode\u003eegg-type\u003c/code\u003e 中哪些资产功能可以采用 Spore 协议，以及繁育、孵化等玩法规则中哪些仍需自定义合约。交易部分也可评估与 Omiga 等现有市场兼容的可行性。\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e钱包接入\u003c/strong\u003e：建议考虑通过 CCC 接入 JoyID 及其他受支持的钱包，让更多社区成员能用自己熟悉的钱包体验游戏。\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e请根据以上反馈修改并重新提交。收到修订稿后，委员会将安排下一轮评审。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e此致\u003cbr\u003e\nxingtian\u003cbr\u003e\n谨代表 Spark Program 委员会\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":5,"updated_at":"2026-11-28T05:59:02.731Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":1.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":11308,"topic_slug":"spark-program-cellcat-ckb","display_username":"行天春彦","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_